    "detailed_description": "Are you ready for an exciting adventure step by step in \u201cPoor Thief\u201d?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this addictive game called \u201cPoor Thief,\u201d you\u2019ll have the chance to become the most skilled thief in the world of theft!<br />\r\nYou\u2019ve been tasked with stealing a legendary diamond collection in the underworld. However, as you steal each diamond, the number of police chasing you will increase. The more diamonds you steal, the more points you\u2019ll earn, but at the same time, the risk of getting caught by the police will also increase.<br />\r\nThe game offers a combination of skill and strategy. <br />\r\nBut be careful, because the police will be watching you at all times! Opportunity to explore new locations and missions with constantly updated content.<br />\r\nAre you ready? Embark on a smuggling adventure in dangerous streets and experience a thrilling adventure with \u201cPoor Thief\u201d!",
